ining lease term or economic useful life, which is on average <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis_us-gaap_LeaseholdImprovementsMember_USAcgzE9Bk28P8Yi3FeTNw" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentUsefulLife" id="Narr_FD9KuMoUI0Chn2gY7ARdmg">5</ix:nonNumeric> to <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis_us-gaap_LeaseholdImprovementsMember_orWXS7gyikODJHxvMwEJDQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentUsefulLife" id="Narr_EKulMpKBd0mCe_tTuMRdaw">8 years</ix:nonNumeric>.</p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-22</p></div></div>
