nt-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company performed assessments of its property and equipment for impairment for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024 and based upon the results of the impairment tests, the Company recorded impairment of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Ph-MWF4h50a-Ita1zyDmbw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis_us-gaap_PropertyPlantAndEquipmentOtherTypesMember_I6rOzEMzl0SdScYHyzX6RA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AssetImpairmentCharges" scale="3" id="Narr_78aidVgeeE2ZVtBSZRwDjA">2,529</ix:nonFraction>, and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Ph-MWF4h50a-Ita1zyDmbw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_us-gaap_PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis_us-gaap_PropertyPlantAndEquipmentOtherTypesMember_zWSTDSrn8UW7brofkqkdfQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AssetImpairmentCharges" scale="3" id="Narr_1rzRNHdVKEucmvp8wL7-xQ">1,706</ix:nonFraction>, respectively, which is included in Impairment of long-lived assets on the consolidated statements of operations and comprehensive loss. The impairment expense is primarily related to the underperformance of the Company&#8217;s various Naples Wax locations in 2025 and the Company&#8217;s various Spa locations in domestic and international airports in 2024. The impairment related to property and equipment is included within the accumulated amortization of the above schedule.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">During the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, the Company recorded depreciation expense of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_Ph-MWF4h50a-Ita1zyDmbw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_X2FTg2M1TE6Fe1gCusu89Q" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:Depreciation" scale="3" id="Narr_ih6aqvlXNkWK1qQ4FWvO8w">560</ix:nonFraction> and 