older of the shares of Series G Preferred Stock may agree to accelerate the conversion of such shares (including any Deferral Amounts (as defined in the Certificate of Designations)) at a conversion price equal to the lower of (i) the Installment Conversion Price (as defined in the Certificate of Designations) applicable to the current Installment Date and (ii) the greater of the Floor Price and (x) <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_Sn6LTLpQc0W0396xJjonFg" contextRef="Duration_11_3_2025_To_11_3_2025_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_xwel_SeriesGConvertiblePreferredStockMember_9wv2AJ3HXUqAwbXHJHOhzA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xwel:TemporaryEquityConversionThresholdPercentageStockPriceTrigger" scale="-2" id="Narr_qm3AZyDRKU-q8h1E65E_8Q">80</ix:nonFraction>% of the dollar volume-weighted average price (&#8220;VWAP&#8221;) of the Common Stock immediately prior to such acceleration, and (y) the average <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_Sx-wRy7IaE2fQkYuPLhtAw" contextRef="Duration_11_3_2025_To_11_3_2025_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_xwel_SeriesGConvertiblePreferredStockMember_9wv2AJ3HXUqAwbXHJHOhzA" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="xwel:TemporaryEquityConversionPriceDeterminationNumberOfAverageDailyVolumeWeightedAveragePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_qeljupX-lEiB9NPWYLT4sQ">three</ix:nonFraction> daily VWAP during the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_D_dFPcadrOqUCtwgqy89td8w" contextRef="Duration_11_3_2025_To_11_3_2025_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_xwel_SeriesGConvertiblePreferredStockMember_9wv2AJ3HXUqAwbXHJHOhzA" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="xwel:TemporaryEquityConversionThresholdConsecutiveTradingDays" scale="0" id="Narr_3O3TZiZ4ZEahh-A_vpOcIA">thirty</ix:nonFraction> consecutive trading days immediately prior to such acceleration. These amendments did not result in any changes to the classification of the Series G Convertible Preferred Stock. However, due to the inclusion of certain 