s-gaap_FairValueByLiabilityClassAxis_us-gaap_EmbeddedDerivativeFinancialInstrumentsMember_us-gaap_FairValueByMeasurementFrequencyAxis_us-gaap_FairValueMeasurementsRecurringMember_s699JlKsEk2y4R00Fie3AQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:FairValueMeasurementWithUnobservableInputsReconciliationsRecurringBasisLiabilityValue" scale="3" id="Tc_PxTI28tHl0uFiZz8rOFJew_6_3">3,870</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In addition to the above, the Company&#8217;s financial instruments as of December 31, 2025 and 2024 consisted of cash and cash equivalents, receivables and accounts payable. The carrying amounts of all the aforementioned financial instruments approximate fair value because of the short-term maturities of these instruments. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The fair values of the Company&#8217;s asset groups were determined using the income approach. The income approach incorporated the use of a discounted cash flow method in which the estimated future cash flows and terminal values for the Company were discounted to the present value using a discount rate. Cash flow projections are based on management&#8217;s estimates of economic and market conditions which drive key assumptions of revenue growth rates, operating margins, capital expenditures and working capital requirements. The discount rate in turn is based on the specific risk characteristics of the Company, the weighted average cost of capital and its underlying forecast.</p></ix:continuation><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_X2FTg2M1TE6Fe1gCusu89Q" name="us-gaap:DisclosureOfCompensationRelatedCostsShareBasedPaymentsTextBlock" id="Tb_uHrbY6KidE-K1jldEQg45g" continuedAt="Tb_uHrbY6KidE-K1jldEQg45g_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Note&#160;12. Stock-based Compensation</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company has a stock-based compensation plan available to grant stock options and RSUs to the Company&#8217;s directors, employees and consultants. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In September 2020, the Board of Directors approved a new stock-based compensation plan available to grant stock options, restricted stock and Restricted Stock Units (&#8220;RSU&#8217;s&#8221;) aggregating to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_0jhmhzR1IEOsuRjq8RdRUg" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2020_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_xwel_EquityIncentivePlan2020Member_IMCbQ5kC9EmP1l-nvLodkA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_ZIOMMDCfTEuaFet96lpSAA">250,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of Common Stock, to the Company&#8217;s directors, employees and consultants. Shareholder approval of the plan was subsequently obtained on October 28, 2020. On October 4, 2022, shareholders approved the amendment to the Company&#8217;s 2020 Equity Incentive Plan to increase the number of shares authorized for issuance under the Plan by <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_0jhmhzR1IEOsuRjq8RdRUg" contextRef="Duration_10_4_2022_To_10_4_2022_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_xwel_EquityIncentivePlan2020Member_PwaBJGWdK0i44poUqgLqJg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfAdditionalSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_e7a3oEPh-EG8pp8s5y03uQ">375,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of Common Stock to an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_0jhmhzR1IEOsuRjq8RdRUg" contextRef="As_Of_10_4_2022_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_xwel_EquityIncentivePlan2020Member_uPLo0-yXiUq7A6sv49ZCXg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_RLaE64eeX0aN1cAmAuLx-w">625,000</ix:nonFraction> shares. On February 13, 2025 shareholders approved an amendment to the Company&#8217;s 2020 Equity Incentive Plan to increase the number of shares authorized for issuance under the Plan by approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_0jhmhzR1IEOsuRjq8RdRUg" contextRef="Duration_2_13_2025_To_2_13_2025_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_xwel_EquityIncentivePlan2020Member_lR05meNmuE-LYl1ghFXsJw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfAdditionalSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_KAYigpid-E6CRt_6MjzOVw">2,500,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of Common Stock to an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_0jhmhzR1IEOsuRjq8RdRUg" contextRef="As_Of_2_13_2025_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_xwel_EquityIncentivePlan2020Member_ud2mvi66S0ySGP4g719tjg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_nLnzY5K4OUK-IkQwhnr2aA">3,125,000</ix:nonFraction> shares. Under the 2020 Equity Incentive Plan (as amended, the &#8220;2020 Plan&#8221;), a maximum of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_0jhmhzR1IEOsuRjq8RdRUg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_xwel_EquityIncentivePlan2020Member_iYnDSDsqRUeyKtPpZLPjxw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardSharesIssuedInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_BWK1aGuQ_EWlzAn88rFRwg">1,552,745</ix:nonFraction> shares of Common Stock remained available for issuance as of December 31, 2025. &#160;</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company&#8217;s previous Employee, Director and Consultant Equity Incentive Plan (the &#8220;2012 Plan&#8221;) was terminated upon receipt of shareholder approval of the 2020 Plan. Awards granted under the 2012 Plan remain in effect pursuant to their terms. Generally, stock options are granted with exercise prices equal to the fair market value on the date of grant, vest in <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_Sx-wRy7IaE2fQkYuPLhtAw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_EYcrJE_7SEecyfENhvecWA" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="xwel:NumberOfEqualQuarterlyVestingInstallment" scale="0" id="Narr_8EiO89c_ykyevnoruEGX3w">four</ix:nonFraction> equal quarterly installments, and expire <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_StockCompensationPlanMember_jhVArKQYOUyBY0LmihWscw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardExpirationPeriod" id="Narr_R5Iqmyi7Lkigyz3gKqmc7A">10 years</ix:nonNumeric> from the date of grant. RSU&#8217;s granted generally vest over a period of <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_StockCompensationPlanMember_jhVArKQYOUyBY0LmihWscw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_fkUYmuT-vk-mHtgcoGc9hQ">one year</ix:nonNumeric>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The fair value of stock options is estimated as of the date of grant using the Black-Scholes option-pricing model. The Company uses the simplified method to estimate the expected term of options due to insufficient history and high turnover in the past.&#160;</p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-36</p></div></div>
